<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BANKING MD MASTER - Nova Subconta</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #0b192c;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #112238;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border: 1px solid #1e3a5f;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        p.subtitle {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #8fa3b8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        label {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #00d2ff;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        input, select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background-color: #0b192c;
            border: 1px solid #234876;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 14px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        input:focus, select:focus {
            border-color: #00d2ff;
            outline: none;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #8fa3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid #1e3a5f;
            padding-top: 15px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .btn-submit {
            background-color: #00d2ff;
            color: #0b192c;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Criar Nova Subconta</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">Cadastre sua carteira vinculada à conta principal para organizar saldos e operar via API.</p>

        <form action="/criar-conta" method="POST">
            <label>Tipo de titular</label>
            <select name="tipo">
                <option value="PF">Pessoa física (PF)</option>
                <option value="PJ">Pessoa jurídica (PJ)</option>
            </select>

            <label>Nome completo</label>
            <input type="text" name="nome" placeholder="Digite seu nome completo" required>

            <label>CPF</label>
            <input type="text" name="cpf" placeholder="000.000.000-00" required>

            <label>Data de nascimento</label>
            <input type="date" name="nascimento" required>

            <label>CEP</label>
            <input type="text" name="cep" placeholder="00000-000" required>

            <div class="section-title">Acesso ao Portal Wallet (opcional)</div>

            <label>E-mail do operador</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="seu@email.com">

            <label>Senha</label>
            <input type="password" name="senha" placeholder="Sua senha de acesso">

            <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Criar subconta</button>
        </form>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
